{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港高等教育科技學院（Thei）正爭取「升格」為應用科學大學。</p><p>校長劉建德今（29日）表示，校方在今年5月已通過最後一項「學科範圍評審」（PAA），正按《專上學院條例》 遞交文件完成註冊，之後會申請「機構評審」。</p><p>另外，Thei全新太古教學中心今日啟用，校方盼方便碩士生上課。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:28.085673+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T05:25:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.611682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:13.352322+00:00","content_hash":"44d92a657ddc7662ab5640255e6f77dc368e1bb10aaf504cc7f67f568a7e6a4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}